  "name": "sol",
  "description": "A lightweight, embeddable scripting language implemented in C that synthesizes features from Lua, Python, and JavaScript. It features a Flex/Bison-based compiler, a re-entrant runtime with type-agnostic object handling, and a reference-counting garbage collector. The language supports multiple paradigms including object-orientation via metamethods, closures, and first-class AST manipulation for self-modifying code.",
